Sure! Here's the translation in UVL code:

```uvl
; Coffee Shop Database

; Drinks
Drinks = Coffee, Tea, Juice, Milkshake

; Foods
Foods = Croissant, Bagel, Sandwich, Pizza

; Payment Methods
PaymentMethods = Card, Cash
```

This code defines the items sold at the coffee shop (drinks and foods), the payment methods available for customers, and organizes them into meaningful categories.